[en.DECISION_C15_ROYAL_SPEECH]
Making a Speech

[en.DECISION_C15_ROYAL_SPEECH_desc]
Flurry Heart attends a CEC routine meeting, and delivers a speech in the name of the Queen, praising the achievements of the CEC and emphasizing the harmony between the memebrs.

[zh.DECISION_C15_ROYAL_SPEECH]
发表演说

[zh.DECISION_C15_ROYAL_SPEECH_desc]
风雪之心亲自出席一次水晶帝国理事会常务会议，在会议上旁听并以女王的名义发表没有实质内容的总结演说，赞扬水晶帝国理事会成立以来取得的成就、强调参会各方的和谐共处。
